<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=5.0, user-scalable=yes">
    <title>About - Bireena Salesi</title>
    
    <!-- Google Fonts -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@600;700&family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary-purple: #7c3aed;
            --primary-purple-dark: #6d28d9;
            --secondary-pink: #ec4899;
            --accent-cyan: #06b6d4;
            --accent-cyan-light: #22d3ee;
            --dark-bg: #0f0318;
            --dark-bg-alt: #1a0b2e;
            --text-primary: #ffffff;
            --text-secondary: #cbd5e1;
            --text-muted: #94a3b8;
            --font-heading: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            --font-body: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html {
            overflow-x: hidden;
            width: 100%;
        }

        body {
            font-family: var(--font-body);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            line-height: 1.6;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 100vw;
            background: 
                radial-gradient(circle at 20% 50%, rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.3) 0%, transparent 50%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 80% 80%, rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.3) 0%, transparent 50%),
                linear-gradient(135deg, #0f0318 0%, #1a0b2e 50%, #2d1b4e 100%);
            background-attachment: fixed;
        }

        /* Global Image and Container Overflow Fix */
        img, svg, video {
            max-width: 100%;
            height: auto;
        }

        section, div {
            max-width: 100%;
        }

        /* Navigation */
        .top-navigation {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 1.5rem 3rem;
            z-index: 100;
            background: rgba(15, 3, 24, 0.8);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.2);
        }

        .nav-container {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .logo span {
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 2.5rem;
            list-style: none;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
            position: relative;
        }

        .nav-links a.active {
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
        }

        .nav-links a.active::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -5px;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 2px;
            background: var(--accent-cyan);
        }

        .nav-links a:hover {
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
        }

        .login-btn {
            padding: 0.75rem 2rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-cyan), var(--primary-purple));
            border: none;
            border-radius: 50px;
            color: white;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
        }

        .login-btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.4);
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero-section {
            position: relative;
            margin-top: 100px;
            padding: 4rem 3rem 2rem 3rem;
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: auto;
        }

        .hero-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.3);
            padding: 0.5rem 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 50px;
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .hero-content {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 4rem;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }

        .hero-text h1 {
            font-family: var(--font-heading);
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            line-height: 1.2;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .hero-text h1 .highlight {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-cyan), var(--primary-purple));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
        }

        .hero-text p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .trust-badge {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-top: 3rem;
        }

        .trust-icons {
            display: flex;
            gap: -15px;
        }

        .trust-icon {
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-purple), var(--secondary-pink));
            border: 3px solid var(--dark-bg);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: white;
        }

        .trust-text {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .trust-text strong {
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .hero-image {
            position: relative;
            height: 500px;
            background: rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.1);
            border-radius: 20px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.2);
            overflow: hidden;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .stats-badge {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 20px;
            right: 20px;
            background: rgba(15, 3, 24, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.4);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
        }

        .stats-badge h3 {
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
        }

        .stats-badge p {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }

        /* Scroll Down Arrow */
        .scroll-arrow {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 2rem;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: rgba(30, 15, 50, 0.8);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border: 2px solid rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.5);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            z-index: 10;
            animation: bounce 2s infinite;
        }

        .scroll-arrow:hover {
            transform: translateX(-50%) scale(1.1);
            border-color: var(--accent-cyan);
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.6);
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.2), rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.2));
        }

        .scroll-arrow svg {
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            font-size: 1.5rem;
        }

        @keyframes bounce {
            0%, 20%, 50%, 80%, 100% {
                transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0);
            }
            40% {
                transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(-10px);
            }
            60% {
                transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(-5px);
            }
        }

        .scroll-arrow:hover {
            animation: none;
        }

        /* Journey Section */
        .journey-section {
            position: relative;
            padding: 2rem 3rem;
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-family: var(--font-heading);
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .section-title .highlight {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-cyan), var(--primary-purple));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
        }

        .journey-content {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 4rem;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .journey-text {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .journey-text p {
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .journey-card {
            background: rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.2);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 2.5rem;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .journey-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            border-color: var(--accent-cyan);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.3);
            background: rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.08);
        }

        .journey-image {
            height: 400px;
            background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.1);
            border-radius: 15px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.2);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        /* Features Section */
        .features-section {
            position: relative;
            padding: 2rem 3rem;
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .features-intro {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto 2rem;
        }

        .features-intro h2 {
            font-family: var(--font-heading);
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .features-intro p {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .features-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .feature-card {
            background: rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.2);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 2.5rem;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }

        .feature-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
            border-color: var(--accent-cyan);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.2);
        }

        .feature-icon {
            width: 70px;
            height: 70px;
            margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-purple), var(--secondary-pink));
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 2rem;
        }

        .feature-card h3 {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }

        .feature-card p {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        /* Team Section */
        .team-section {
            position: relative;
            padding: 2rem 3rem;
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .team-intro h2 {
            font-family: var(--font-heading);
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .team-intro p {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto 2rem;
        }

        .team-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .team-card {
            background: rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.2);
            border-radius: 20px;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .team-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
            border-color: var(--accent-cyan);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.2);
        }

        .team-image {
            height: 300px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.3), rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.3));
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .team-info {
            padding: 2rem;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .team-info h3 {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .team-info .role {
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .team-info p {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .team-social {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1rem;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }

        .social-icon {
            width: 35px;
            height: 35px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.3);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .social-icon:hover {
            background: var(--accent-cyan);
            color: white;
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }

        /* Footer */
        .footer {
            background: rgba(15, 3, 24, 0.9);
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.2);
            padding: 4rem 3rem 2rem;
            margin-top: 5rem;
        }

        .footer-content {
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }

        .footer-brand h3 {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .footer-brand .highlight {
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
        }

        .footer-contact {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-top: 1.5rem;
        }

        .contact-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 0.8rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .contact-icon {
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            margin-top: 3px;
        }

        .footer-section h4 {
            color: var(--text-primary);
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        .footer-links {
            list-style: none;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.8rem;
        }

        .footer-links a {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }

        .footer-links a:hover {
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
        }

        .footer-hours {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .footer-hours .time {
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .social-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-top: 1.5rem;
        }

        .social-link {
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.3);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .social-link:hover {
            background: var(--accent-cyan);
            color: white;
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }

        .footer-bottom {
            text-align: center;
            padding-top: 2rem;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.2);
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .footer-bottom a {
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        /* Scroll to Top Button */
        .scroll-to-top {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 30px;
            right: 30px;
            width: 55px;
            height: 55px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-cyan), var(--primary-purple));
            border: none;
            border-radius: 50%;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            opacity: 0;
            visibility: hidden;
            transform: translateY(100px);
            transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.68, -0.55, 0.265, 1.55);
            z-index: 999;
            box-shadow: 
                0 8px 25px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.4),
                0 0 20px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.3),
                inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
        }

        .scroll-to-top.show {
            opacity: 1;
            visibility: visible;
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        .scroll-to-top:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px) scale(1.1);
            box-shadow: 
                0 12px 35px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.6),
                0 0 30px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.5),
                inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
        }

        .scroll-to-top:active {
            transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.05);
        }

        .scroll-to-top svg {
            color: white;
            filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3));
            animation: arrowBounce 2s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        @keyframes arrowBounce {
            0%, 100% {
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
            50% {
                transform: translateY(-5px);
            }
        }

        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 968px) {
            .hero-content,
            .journey-content {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .features-grid,
            .team-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }

            .footer-content {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            }

            .scroll-to-top {
                bottom: 20px;
                right: 20px;
                width: 50px;
                height: 50px;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 640px) {
            .features-grid,
            .team-grid,
            .footer-content {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .nav-links {
                display: none;
            }

            .scroll-to-top {
                bottom: 15px;
                right: 15px;
                width: 45px;
                height: 45px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <!-- Navigation -->
    <nav class="top-navigation">
        <div class="nav-container">
            <a href="/" class="logo">BIREENA<span>SALESI</span></a>
            <ul class="nav-links">
                <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                <li><a href="/about" class="active">About</a></li>
                <li><a href="/features">Features</a></li>
                <li><a href="/pricing">Pricing</a></li>
                <li><a href="/contact">Contact</a></li>
            </ul>
            <a href="/login" class="login-btn">Login →</a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero-section">
        <span class="hero-badge">About Bireena Salesi</span>
        
        <div class="hero-content">
            <div class="hero-text">
                <h1>
                    Elevating Sales Management<br>
                    <span class="highlight">to New Heights</span>
                </h1>
                <p>
                    We're not just a software company – we're your partner in transforming business operations. 
                    Our mission is to make sales and inventory management more efficient, more intuitive, and more profitable.
                </p>

                <div class="trust-badge">
                    <div class="trust-icons">
                        <div class="trust-icon">🏨</div>
                        <div class="trust-icon">✓</div>
                        <div class="trust-icon">⭐</div>
                        <div class="trust-icon">💎</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="trust-text">
                        Trusted by <strong>500+</strong> businesses across India
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="hero-image">
                <div style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 1rem;">Sales Management Illustration</div>
                <div class="stats-badge">
                    <h3>98% Success Rate</h3>
                    <p>In Implementation</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="scroll-arrow" onclick="document.querySelector('.journey-section').scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth' })">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
            </svg>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Journey Section -->
    <section class="journey-section">
        <h2 class="section-title" style="text-align: center; font-size: 3.5rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;">Our <span class="highlight">Journey</span></h2>
        
        <!-- Where It All Started - Left Content, Right Image -->
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 3rem; margin-bottom: 3rem; align-items: stretch;">
            <div class="journey-card" style="padding: 2.5rem; height: 350px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center;">
                <h3 style="color: #00d4ff; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; font-size: 1.6rem; border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(0, 212, 255, 0.3); padding-bottom: 0.8rem;">Where It All Started</h3>
                <p style="margin-bottom: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.8; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9); font-size: 1.05rem;">
                    Launched in 2025, Bireena Selsi was created from a simple idea — to make complex sales operations easy, transparent, and efficient.
                </p>
                <div style="background: rgba(0, 212, 255, 0.05); padding: 1.2rem; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #00d4ff;">
                    <p style="margin: 0; line-height: 1.7; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);">
                        Our name blends <strong style="color: #00d4ff;">"Bireena"</strong> (excellence) with <strong style="color: #ff4d94;">"Selsi"</strong> (sales), symbolizing our mission to bring excellence to every stage of the sales journey.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="journey-image" style="height: 350px;">
                <div style="color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4); font-size: 1.1rem;">Journey Visualization</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- The Evolution - Left Image, Right Content -->
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 3rem; margin-bottom: 3rem; align-items: stretch;">
